{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22996","headline":"春江闲步赠张山人 · 白居易","name":"春江闲步赠张山人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江景又妍和，牵愁发浩歌。\n晴沙金屑色，春水麴尘波。\n红簇交枝杏，青含卷叶荷。\n藉莎怜輭暖，憩树爱婆娑。\n书信朝贤断，知音野老多。\n相逢不闲语，争奈日长何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22996.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22996","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}